  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t2WikiMultihopQA Dataset with GPT-3.5 Generated Questions\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThis repository hosts an enhanced version of the 2WikiMultihopQA dataset, where each supporting sentence in the dataset has been supplemented with questions generated using OpenAI's GPT-3.5 turbo API. The aim is to provide a richer context for each entry, potentially benefiting various NLP tasks, such as question answering and context understanding.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Format\n\t\n\nEach entry in the\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/scholarly-shadows-syndicate/2wikimultihopqa_with_q_gpt35.",
